// The lawful twin: the same notice, differing by one line, REPORTS added. It is clean, and that is
// the finding. Print "has no time" (media.json), so no motion can occur on it, yet a motion that
// reports is admitted without a word. The rule is satisfied in a medium where it cannot apply.
// Recorded as PROJECTION GAP PG-1 in doc/design/COVERAGE.md; it is NOT turned into a rule.
//
// Expected: clean

DEFINE VIBE printed_notice (
  SURFACE_AS print,
  MOTION fade,
  REPORTS [save_state]
)
